    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1641">

                <pb facs="1408" n="1304" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1304"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 816.001Ar1.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to the President of Salvador.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The White House</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-02-06">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 6, 1913</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am shocked to learn of the dastardly attempt on Your Excellency’s life and
                    hasten to express the hope of this Government and my personal earnest wish for
                    your speedy recovery.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William Howard Taft</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
